side the library premises temporarily."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Public libraries also provide free services such as preschool story times to encourage early literacy among children."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Their mandate is to serve the general public''s information needs rather than the needs of a particular school, institution, or research population."}, {"id": "D", "text": "A public library is a library, most often a lending library, that is accessible by the general public and is usually funded from public sources, such as taxes."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'wikipedia-cc-by-sa-4', 'Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)', 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Wikipedia, "Public library", CC BY-SA 4.0, retrieved 2026-11-02. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_library', FALSE, 'active') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET external_id = EXCLUDED.external_id, assessments = EXCLUDED.assessments, section = EXCLUDED.section, domain = EXCLUDED.domain, skill = EXCLUDED.skill, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, format = EXCLUDED.format, stimulus = EXCLUDED.stimulus, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, figure_metadata = EXCLUDED.figure_metadata, source_id = EXCLUDED.source_id, source_name = EXCLUDED.source_name, license = EXCLUDED.license, attribution = EXCLUDED.attribution, is_released_practice_set = EXCLUDED.is_released_practice_set, status = 'active';
INSERT INTO public.question_keys (question_id, correct_answer, acceptable_answers, explanation, distractor_rationales) VALUES ('RW-M21-CE010', 'C', ARRAY['C']::TEXT[], 'The correct quotation explicitly contrasts the general public''s needs with those of specialized institutions.', '{"D": "This sentence describes access and funding.", "B": "This sentence describes a service for young children.", "A": "This sentence describes borrowing."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, acceptable_answers = EXCLUDED.acceptable_answers, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, distractor_rationales = EXCLUDED.distractor_rationales;
